      "width": 260,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Checkpoints\nStates: `LoginPage`, `LoggedIn`, `ItemInCart`\n\n[[Checkpoints]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "4d42edf1d9ce5a85",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 330,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Blocks\nOne step from a Checkpoint to another (the clip)\n\n[[Blocks]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec419bddd37cfe0f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Flows\n`map()` lines Blocks up - the timeline. Cuts must line up\n\n[[Flows]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "67734b124d5267f0",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 980,
