      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5c0f7b8d78b4810",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Plan\nspec -> steps\n`runner/plan/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "518e19d0aa23ccda",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 250,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Session\nopen the browser\n`runner/session.ts`"
    },
    {
      "id": "45e3ecefb6006a1b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## One loop\nfor each step: before -> engine -> after\n`runner/play-steps.ts`"
    },
    {
      "id": "8a034d64dde6e9db",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## The engine\nact -> observe -> resolve -> verify\n\n[[The Engine]]",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "d6dafdf173542265",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "## Mode\n**run**: nothing around\n**demo**: panels, rings, Next\n**report**: JSON\n**branches**: every route\n\n[[Playing a Flow]]",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "dea027e07e124485",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 460,
      "label": "Outputs",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "5a4ced159d34f3e8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## What waygraph writes\nrun log `.waygraph/runs/*.jsonl`\nvideo, JSON report\nmanifest\n\n[[What Waygraph Writes]]"
    },
    {
